---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="py-12 px-6 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-6 animate-fade-in">
      Resume Overview
    </h1>

    <p class="text-md text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mb-6 animate-fade-in-up leading-relaxed">
      You can download my full resume below. Here's a quick summary of my background and experience:
    </p>

    <ul class="text-gray-400 mb-8 space-y-1 text-sm max-w-xl animate-fade-in-up">
      <li> /  15+ years of experience with Linux and Unix systems.</li>
      <li> /  Certified in AWS, cybersecurity, and DevOps practices.</li>
      <li> /  Worked with Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, GitHub Actions.</li>
      <li> /  Automated deployments with Ansible and Terraform.</li>
      <li> /  Delivered scalable, secure infrastructure for fintech and enterprise clients.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="flex gap-4 animate-fade-in-up">
      <a href="/cv.pdf" class="border border-accent text-accent px-4 py-2 hover:bg-accent hover:text-black transition">
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/projects" class="border border-gray-600 text-gray-300 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition">
        View Projects
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-fit border border-gray-700 rounded-md bg-[#0a0a0a] shadow-lg font-mono text-sm animate-fade-in-up">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 border-b border-gray-700 bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-t-md">
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></span>
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 ml-2">bytefuck@localhost</span>
      </div>
      <div class="px-4 py-3 text-green-400">
        <p class="mb-1">$ curl -O https://bytefuck.club/cv.pdf</p>
        <p class="text-gray-500"># direct download.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
